{
  "packet": 4,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012860","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，蹲姿比站姿更容易瞄准。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012860","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"如果在意准星晃动，也可以把研发力量投入这一方向。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012860","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我会记住。不过枪这东西用久了才会趁手，太过喜新厌旧也不见得好。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012CF0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"选择哪套制服非常重要，要根据任务目标和你的战斗风格灵活使用。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012E10","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“JUNGLE FATIGUES”是用于丛林的野战服，可以说是标准战斗服。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012E10","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"它的特点是迷彩率会随区域产生很大差异。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012E10","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"穿着能融入周围环境的图案，迷彩率就会提高。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012E10","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"反过来，如果与环境格格不入，就很容易被发现。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_012E10","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"也就是说要根据情况选用，Sigint以前也经常这样教训我。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013100","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"潜行服是专为潜入任务设计的服装，在任何关卡都能保持较高迷彩率。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013100","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不会发出脚步声也是一大优点。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013100","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"也就是说，不必蹑手蹑脚地走路了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013100","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"受伤后的恢复速度也会提高。据说纤维会适度压迫身体，产生止血效果。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013100","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那可帮大忙了。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013630","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“NAKED”……顾名思义就是裸身，裤子倒是和JUNGLE FATIGUES相同。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013630","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"身体直接暴露在外，防御力和迷彩率自然都很低。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013630","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"喂，Snake。听说你以前的代号，就是因为总穿成这样四处大闹才得来的，是真的吗？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013B70","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"CO-OPS的基本单位是<R=两人小组,TWO-MAN CELL>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013B70","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"但一人被发现，另一人也会身陷危险；而且狭小地点可能根本藏不下两个人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013B70","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"没错。不过最重要的，还是伙伴之间的羁绊。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013B70","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"正是如此。两人小组潜入是有利还是不利，全看两人的配合。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_013B70","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"另外，若战斗目标明确，投入更多人员作战也会很有效。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014170","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"还不止如此，连<R=生命,LIFE槽>也会共享。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014170","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我知道。以本大爷如此丰富的经验，那段距离看得一清二楚，就像一道<R=圆环,RING>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014170","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不愧是Boss。那就把进入这道<R=圆环,CO-OP RING>称为CO-OP IN吧。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014600","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"虽然和你的代号相同，但你擅长单独潜入，以前应该不太熟悉这种队形。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014600","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过在CO-OPS中，这也是种有效队形。把手搭上对方肩膀，就是进入蛇形编队的信号。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014A80","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当然，在战斗中进行心脏按压很危险，因为那段时间你自己也会暴露在危险中。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014A80","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"任务中如果你和所有伙伴都死了，就再也没人能救援。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014A80","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"那就<R=结束,游戏结束>了。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当然。我可不想把后背交给不可信的人。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"衡量这种关系的指标就是“友情度”，可以把它看成你与CO-OPS伙伴之间羁绊强度的体现。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"相比各自战斗，CO-OP IN时友情度会更高；通过心脏按压救活濒死伙伴，也会加深羁绊。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"反过来，要是<R=误伤伙伴,友军误伤>让对方受伤，友情度自然会下降。","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_INCOMPLETE_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0150C0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"Snake Sync的效果取决于友情度，友情度当然越高越好，对吧？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"在Snake IN状态下保持不动，两人的心跳便会开始<R=同步,SYNC>。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"没错。心跳完全同步后，就会进入Snake Sync状态，借助与伙伴的协同效应发挥出超常力量。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对。在关键时刻，先冷静下来完成同步也是一种办法。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"刚才也说过，Snake Sync的效果取决于你和对方的友情度。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0157A0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那当然。和知根知底的人搭档，双方能互相掩护死角，也就更能专注于自己的行动。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_015C40","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"英雄度越高，就连富尔顿回收来的敌兵也不用花太多时间说服。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_015C40","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"方法很多：完成艰难任务、避免无谓杀戮……反过来，要是被敌人发现后惊慌失措，英雄度可不会提高。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_015C40","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不必想得太复杂，照Boss平时的做法就行。在我看来，你已经是个名副其实的英雄了。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0161A0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"研发班似乎正在研究CO-OPS专用武器。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0161A0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"CO-OPS专用？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0161A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"比如一种必须两人同时开火才能发挥威力的枪……相应地攻击力会很高，不过听说目前还只是构想。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0161A0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"火箭发射器确实有两人一组操作的，可CO-OPS专用武器还真少见。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0161A0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"但要是开发成功，CO-OPS也会更有意思。记得关注武器研发进度。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016490","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当然。战场上联络中断，会直接导致部队覆灭。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016490","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"随后第一次按键选择类别，第二次按键选择实际要说的话。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，你知道日本有个词叫“言灵”吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"言灵……？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"话语中寄宿着灵性力量，并会影响现实……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"喂喂，你没事吧？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我的说法太可疑了吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过，你没试过因为伙伴鼓励而发挥出意外的力量吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"反过来，也可能因一句伤人的话，连一半实力都发挥不出来。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这么说我就懂了。言语对人的精神状态确实影响很大。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"CO-OPS通信也是一样。一句鼓励，或许就能让伙伴跑得比平时更快。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"甚至能让本应濒死倒地的人重新站起来……对吧？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"原来如此，反过来也同样有效吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016AE0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"话语能产生各种力量，你多试试看。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，关于纸箱……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"哦！","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"由我向你说明纸箱，总觉得有点奇怪。不过这次有不少不同之处，保险起见还是让我讲一下。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"好。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"纸箱不只能套在身上躲藏，也可以直接放在地上。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"哦？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"踩在上面可以越过一些小高差，也能躲在后面避开敌兵视线。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这变化不错。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"还不止如此，也能装入物品寄给CO-OPS伙伴。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"还能这么用？纸箱果然无所不能，是战士的必需品。我还真没想到这种用法。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不，这才是纸箱原本的用途……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"说起来，这一带的纸箱是不是稍大一些？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"没错。紧贴在一起的话，两个人也能同时钻进去，俗称“爱情纸箱”。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"爱情纸箱……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017000","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"对。不过也不一定非得是爱情纸箱，只要大小相同，都能装下两个人。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"}
  ]
}
